  "_comment": "@epa/core is a devDependency on purpose: it is bundled into dist/cli.mjs at build time, so the published package has no runtime dependencies. The range is \"*\" rather than \"workspace:*\" because the workspace protocol is not valid semver and would end up verbatim in the published package.json.",
